==English==

===Etymology===
Apparently from a confusion of two similar {{etyl|nl|en}} words. The first of these is the obsolete {{m|nl|mallemerok||foolish woman}}, from {{m|nl|malle||foolish}} + {{m|nl|marok}}, from {{etyl|fr|en}} {{m|fr|marotte||object of foolish affection, [[bauble]]}}. The second word is {{m|nl|mallemok||sailor of a whaling vessel}}.

